// Article 5. Distributions.
#require "3-incapacity.charter".
Power pay-settlor Actor person Related to usd
  Holds when trustee(person) && Not(deceased(Margaret))
  Valid when trustee(person) && Not(deceased(Margaret)) && usd <= fund.usd
  Creates fund(fund.usd - usd)

Function share Identified by person * usd
Extend Event death
  Creates share(Anna, MulDivRound(fund.usd, 1, 2, Floor)), share(Ben, MulDivRound(fund.usd, 1, 2, Floor)), fund(0)
    When person == Margaret

Fact reached-twenty-five Identified by person
Fact paid Identified by person * usd
Power pay-share Actor person Recipient person'
  Holds when trustee(person)
  Valid when trustee(person) && reached-twenty-five(person')
  Creates (Foreach share: paid(person', share.usd) When share.person == person')
  Terminates (Foreach share: share When share.person == person')

Clause 5.1 Approved "a26b59b003be98cf7ea76c47b8cef17014f0deb8808bfb5a772e7167619729d1"
  Norm "During the settlor's life the trustee pays the settlor whatever she requests from the trust fund." => pay-settlor
Clause 5.2 Approved "956598b47f36adaff9c64f925ae366fa3a89bba55ce5275a51e042e55d341640"
  Definition "At the settlor's death the trust fund is divided between Anna Ellis and Ben Ellis in equal shares."
Clause 5.3 Approved "70a2c19f9316597cdafe205dbd19c60be8ddbd9f0904daded846b2f5b7bfd2be"
  Norm "The trustee holds a beneficiary's share until that beneficiary reaches the age of twenty-five, and then pays it to the beneficiary." => pay-share
.
